*  SKIM_driver - exercises SKIM(S): "skims off" the first appearance of each
*  different character of S and returns the result.  Contract per skim.inc
*  header, whose own worked example is SKIM("MISSISSIPPI") -> "MISP".
-INCLUDE "skim.inc"
        OUTPUT  =  SKIM('MISSISSIPPI')
        OUTPUT  =  SKIM('ABC')
        OUTPUT  =  SKIM('AAAA')
        OUTPUT  =  SKIM('ABABAB')
        OUTPUT  =  SKIM('')
        OUTPUT  =  SKIM('THE QUICK BROWN FOX')
END
